<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis results due March 26.</title>
<headline>Fortis results due March 26.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch-Belgian financial group Fortis said on Monday it would publish its 1996 full-year results on Wednesday, March 26.</p>
<p>The group's 1996 annual report will be published on Tuesday, April 29, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>The parent companies of Fortis, Dutch Fortis Amev and Belgian Fortis AG, will both hold their separate general shareholders' meetings on May 28.</p>
<p>Fortis Amev will hold its meeting in Utrecht and Fortis AG in Brussels.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
